MAME

Parts of the C64 emulation (c64/src/commonMain/kotlin/c64slop/c64/) follow the
behavior of MAME's C64 driver and devices (https://github.com/mamedev/mame),
which use the same BSD 3-Clause License as C64slop. No MAME code is copied.

  C64Machine.kt, C64MemoryBus.kt, IoDevice.kt, KeyboardMatrix.kt:
    src/mame/commodore/c64.cpp
    copyright-holders: Curt Coder
  Cia6526.kt: src/devices/machine/mos6526.cpp
    copyright-holders: Curt Coder

  license: BSD-3-Clause

